WEBVTT

00:00:08.375 --> 00:00:13.135
. hack//Legend of the Twilight

00:00:15.915 --> 00:00:22.945
Tell me nanimo wakaranai no demo
Tell me I don't
understand anything, but

00:00:23.115 --> 00:00:30.115
You say itsumo sonna kotoba mo
You always say
those kinds of words, too

00:00:31.065 --> 00:00:37.865
Surechigau dake no
You find another way
You find another way where
we only pass each other by

00:00:38.305 --> 00:00:44.965
Owatteku sekai wo tobidashite
You know?
And rush out into a world
that's ending, you know?

00:00:45.275 --> 00:00:50.835
Hello Hello It's a New World
Hello, hello, it's a New World!

00:00:51.115 --> 00:00:54.515
Hikari yori hayaku
Faster than light,

00:00:55.285 --> 00:00:59.315
monokuro no supiido de
with monochromatic speed

00:00:59.625 --> 00:01:05.155
Hello Hello It's a New World
Hello, hello, it's a New World!

00:01:05.395 --> 00:01:08.925
Jikan yori tooku
Farther than time,

00:01:09.735 --> 00:01:14.465
kakenukeru You're so far away
I run through it; you're so far away

00:01:30.115 --> 00:01:34.855
The Phoenix Feather

00:01:48.075 --> 00:01:49.695
Excuse me.

00:01:51.775 --> 00:01:53.765
I have a request.

00:01:54.445 --> 00:01:57.075
A... request?

00:01:57.675 --> 00:02:00.585
Starting tomorrow, or rather today...

00:02:00.785 --> 00:02:03.115
...I'll be away on a trip for three days.

00:02:03.815 --> 00:02:07.585
So, during that time, my Grunty...

00:02:09.595 --> 00:02:12.565
I'm looking for someone
to take care of it.

00:02:14.865 --> 00:02:16.835
You can't?

00:02:20.535 --> 00:02:21.905
It's only for three days.

00:02:22.235 --> 00:02:24.065
Just three days.

00:02:25.445 --> 00:02:26.565
Please. Please.

00:02:34.815 --> 00:02:36.345
I'm hungry, oink.

00:02:36.385 --> 00:02:38.185
Give me something to eat, oink.

00:02:38.685 --> 00:02:39.615
Tah-dah.

00:02:40.855 --> 00:02:43.755
This is Mireille-chan's secret room!

00:02:44.625 --> 00:02:46.715
In other words, a
"Rare Item" storeroom.

00:02:46.995 --> 00:02:48.225
Wow.

00:02:48.565 --> 00:02:50.585
So you managed to get
a hidden room made?

00:02:52.435 --> 00:02:54.565
This is a rare item as well.

00:02:55.235 --> 00:02:55.725
But.

00:02:56.835 --> 00:02:59.205
Right now, what I want the most is...

00:03:01.675 --> 00:03:03.505
What a nice texture!

00:03:04.215 --> 00:03:06.145
Let's go home after all, Shugo!

00:03:07.185 --> 00:03:09.205
Aaaah, wait!

00:03:09.685 --> 00:03:12.625
I won't say that I want it ever again!

00:03:14.425 --> 00:03:16.555
This is a pretty interesting storeroom.

00:03:17.125 --> 00:03:20.325
Shall we stay here
for a little bit, Shugo?

00:03:25.765 --> 00:03:26.295
And?

00:03:28.875 --> 00:03:29.495
Well?

00:03:30.905 --> 00:03:32.495
Just as I thought.

00:03:33.005 --> 00:03:35.165
It's a really high-level item.

00:03:36.045 --> 00:03:36.845
You can tell?

00:03:37.475 --> 00:03:38.135
Look.

00:03:38.685 --> 00:03:40.075
The higher the level...

00:03:40.315 --> 00:03:43.615
...the stiffer the design
and the better the quality.

00:03:44.215 --> 00:03:45.375
Shugo's bracelet is...

00:03:45.655 --> 00:03:49.115
...probably the highest
level bracelet you can get.

00:03:50.225 --> 00:03:51.485
This thing?

00:03:53.225 --> 00:03:54.495
Mireille!

00:03:55.495 --> 00:03:58.465
It's not like I actually
said that I wanted it.

00:03:58.665 --> 00:03:59.865
Your eyes say it all!

00:04:00.635 --> 00:04:02.865
If it's such an incredible
bracelet then...

00:04:14.685 --> 00:04:16.585
W-Why won't my sword move?

00:04:17.115 --> 00:04:20.215
Is the data drain exerting
its effects upon us?

00:04:20.555 --> 00:04:21.725
This is revenge for earlier!

00:04:21.725 --> 00:04:25.155
Vak Dom! Vak Dom! Vak Dom!

00:04:25.265 --> 00:04:28.095
Why won't my spells work?

00:04:28.735 --> 00:04:31.095
Shugo. I love you!

00:04:33.265 --> 00:04:35.495
I wonder why that
turned out that way?

00:04:36.005 --> 00:04:37.765
It's your fault.

00:04:37.975 --> 00:04:38.535
Yeah.

00:04:39.305 --> 00:04:40.405
Huh?

00:04:41.005 --> 00:04:44.465
To use a high level item perfectly...

00:04:45.115 --> 00:04:47.985
...the user must be of high level too.

00:04:49.555 --> 00:04:51.245
You mean, I can't?

00:04:52.655 --> 00:04:53.275
That's right!

00:04:54.625 --> 00:04:56.215
Let's go train!

00:04:57.425 --> 00:04:59.395
H... here?

00:05:00.125 --> 00:05:01.895
This is a mid-level area.

00:05:02.195 --> 00:05:04.165
I'm still a newbie.

00:05:04.165 --> 00:05:06.635
Don't worry. I'm with you.

00:05:07.365 --> 00:05:09.335
Alright, let's go.

00:05:10.305 --> 00:05:11.495
I've been itching to do this!

00:05:12.505 --> 00:05:13.595
Me too!

00:05:13.945 --> 00:05:15.105
Huh!?

00:05:15.745 --> 00:05:18.215
H-hey... wait.

00:05:22.155 --> 00:05:23.585
It's a Squilla Demon!

00:05:23.885 --> 00:05:25.405
Easy win! Easy win!

00:05:39.135 --> 00:05:40.795
Vak Dom!

00:05:44.435 --> 00:05:45.035
You're in the way!

00:05:50.115 --> 00:05:50.875
Big brother!

00:05:51.445 --> 00:05:52.845
Shugo, get back!

00:05:53.515 --> 00:05:54.245
But...

00:05:54.615 --> 00:05:56.945
...I'm the one that has to level up.

00:05:59.425 --> 00:06:00.355
It's all right!

00:06:00.485 --> 00:06:01.645
But...

00:06:11.765 --> 00:06:14.325
I've leveled up?

00:06:14.435 --> 00:06:16.735
You don't have to kill
the enemy directly.

00:06:16.875 --> 00:06:18.565
You just have to be a part of...

00:06:18.775 --> 00:06:20.505
...the fight and your level will go up.

00:06:20.905 --> 00:06:24.005
That's why you can just swing your...

00:06:24.045 --> 00:06:26.035
...sword at the enemy
from back there, Shugo.

00:06:27.145 --> 00:06:28.275
Huh?

00:06:31.085 --> 00:06:33.355
Is that for certain?

00:06:33.685 --> 00:06:36.815
Yes. I've checked many things.

00:06:37.225 --> 00:06:38.355
I can only conclude...

00:06:38.725 --> 00:06:41.055
...that someone changed the
character campaign page.

00:06:41.225 --> 00:06:42.715
I cannot say who
that could have been.

00:06:45.305 --> 00:06:46.465
What about the
system administrators?

00:06:47.605 --> 00:06:49.035
I asked.

00:06:50.105 --> 00:06:51.235
They replied that they had no...

00:06:51.605 --> 00:06:53.135
...answer regarding
the matter in question.

00:06:54.175 --> 00:06:56.475
Then report it as a level one claim.

00:06:57.215 --> 00:06:58.675
There should be a
reaction from someone.

00:06:59.715 --> 00:07:00.775
Understood.

00:07:04.825 --> 00:07:06.985
Those two. It can't be.

00:07:09.055 --> 00:07:12.425
L-Lord Balmung. What's that?

00:07:13.525 --> 00:07:15.755
Bamboo grass means pandas.

00:07:16.495 --> 00:07:18.365
That's why it's Panda bread.

00:07:41.825 --> 00:07:43.795
You're amazing, Divine Fist Ohka!

00:07:43.955 --> 00:07:45.755
Vak Dom!

00:07:49.435 --> 00:07:50.655
You're taking things too lightly.

00:07:51.505 --> 00:07:52.595
Don't let your guard down.

00:07:53.135 --> 00:07:54.225
And don't move in a straight line.

00:07:54.465 --> 00:07:55.995
Move from side to side.

00:07:57.375 --> 00:07:58.495
R-right!

00:08:03.915 --> 00:08:06.575
I'll get you all! Vak Dom!

00:08:17.125 --> 00:08:18.825
What is this warm
feeling rising within me?

00:08:18.895 --> 00:08:20.525
I've leveled up quite a bit, right?

00:08:21.065 --> 00:08:23.395
Guys! I'm amazing!

00:08:23.395 --> 00:08:23.765
Ohka, you're the coolest!
Guys! I'm amazing!

00:08:23.765 --> 00:08:24.755
Ohka, you're the coolest!

00:08:24.805 --> 00:08:24.935
That's nothing.

00:08:24.935 --> 00:08:26.035
Everyone, look at me!
That's nothing.

00:08:26.035 --> 00:08:26.065
Everyone, look at me!

00:08:26.065 --> 00:08:27.405
Everyone, look at me!
I still have a long way to go.

00:08:27.405 --> 00:08:28.005
Everyone, look at me!
We're on the right track.

00:08:28.005 --> 00:08:29.025
We're on the right track.

00:08:29.175 --> 00:08:30.665
Um... I've leveled up.

00:08:33.345 --> 00:08:35.535
You've leveled up quite a bit.

00:08:36.245 --> 00:08:37.845
I-Is that so?

00:08:37.845 --> 00:08:39.745
You've still got a long ways to go.

00:08:40.845 --> 00:08:42.905
Compared to Ohka.

00:08:44.015 --> 00:08:46.315
You've got a long way to go too, Rena.

00:08:47.525 --> 00:08:50.885
Rena's level is much higher than yours.

00:08:52.365 --> 00:08:53.625
Why's that?

00:08:53.895 --> 00:08:55.265
We started at the same time.

00:08:56.035 --> 00:08:57.555
I've been training in secret...

00:08:57.795 --> 00:08:59.395
...when you weren't around.

00:08:59.965 --> 00:09:02.435
That's sneaky. It's always about you.

00:09:02.505 --> 00:09:03.475
I'm sorry.

00:09:04.805 --> 00:09:06.705
Ah! A treasure box!

00:09:08.645 --> 00:09:09.975
No, Shugo, don't!

00:09:16.815 --> 00:09:19.655
That was a trapped treasure box.

00:09:19.955 --> 00:09:20.855
You okay?

00:09:26.065 --> 00:09:28.155
A level down trap, huh?

00:09:28.535 --> 00:09:28.925
Huh?

00:09:29.865 --> 00:09:33.135
Shugo, you're back down to level 1.

00:09:33.305 --> 00:09:34.465
No way!

00:09:34.835 --> 00:09:37.825
You'll just have to try again, Shugo!

00:09:38.845 --> 00:09:40.865
I can't stand this anymore!

00:09:41.775 --> 00:09:42.575
Shugo!

00:09:44.615 --> 00:09:45.875
Shugo.

00:09:52.955 --> 00:09:54.925
Why'd that girl...

00:09:56.955 --> 00:09:58.615
...give this thing to me?

00:10:13.575 --> 00:10:16.275
Is it sick?

00:10:16.475 --> 00:10:17.965
Yes, he's sick!

00:10:18.385 --> 00:10:19.875
I don't know what to do!

00:10:21.985 --> 00:10:23.715
So you were asked by a stranger?

00:10:24.015 --> 00:10:26.215
My name is Hotaru.

00:10:26.425 --> 00:10:28.415
I've never raised a Grunty.

00:10:28.755 --> 00:10:30.055
Do you have any friends you can call?

00:10:30.295 --> 00:10:33.355
One. He's very dependable.

00:10:33.825 --> 00:10:36.125
But I haven't seen him at all today.

00:10:36.835 --> 00:10:39.895
So you are at a loss... eh.

00:10:49.745 --> 00:10:52.175
Oh! This is terrible.

00:10:52.815 --> 00:10:55.045
This one has the Grunty Flu.

00:10:55.715 --> 00:10:57.705
It wasn't vaccinated?

00:10:59.725 --> 00:11:01.985
It's a terrible sickness.

00:11:02.725 --> 00:11:05.855
If you don't do anything,
it'll die within a few hours.

00:11:07.195 --> 00:11:09.325
Isn't there a way to save it?

00:11:10.065 --> 00:11:12.725
The cure for this is
the "Phoenix Feather".

00:11:13.465 --> 00:11:18.565
It's located within the dungeons
of "Blazing Purgatory Valley".

00:11:19.975 --> 00:11:21.535
What kind of area is it?

00:11:22.015 --> 00:11:23.805
It's a fairly high level area.

00:11:24.345 --> 00:11:27.575
It might be difficult for a newbie.

00:11:31.085 --> 00:11:32.515
Shugo?

00:11:36.025 --> 00:11:39.615
It's all right. I have strong friends!

00:11:40.925 --> 00:11:43.155
You're at it again, playing
games since lunchtime!

00:11:43.235 --> 00:11:46.565
Today's Sunday!
I can do anything I want!

00:11:46.635 --> 00:11:48.835
You play games during the week too!

00:11:49.335 --> 00:11:50.535
The school's contacted me saying...

00:11:50.835 --> 00:11:52.065
...that you haven't been going to class.

00:11:56.645 --> 00:11:59.735
Why can't I get in touch with anyone?

00:12:00.915 --> 00:12:02.045
What about you?

00:12:02.915 --> 00:12:04.115
It's no good.

00:12:12.365 --> 00:12:14.795
Then we have to try ourselves!

00:12:35.255 --> 00:12:36.445
"Blazing"

00:12:36.915 --> 00:12:38.145
"Purgatory"

00:12:38.925 --> 00:12:40.045
"Valley"

00:12:55.435 --> 00:12:56.465
Is this the place?

00:12:57.975 --> 00:12:59.495
Fairy's Orb!

00:13:04.575 --> 00:13:06.175
What are those marks?

00:13:07.045 --> 00:13:10.845
If we fight the monsters, at our level...

00:13:10.955 --> 00:13:14.015
...there's only a slim
chance that we could win.

00:13:15.555 --> 00:13:16.955
And now, this.

00:13:17.795 --> 00:13:19.225
A Speed Charm.

00:13:19.795 --> 00:13:20.885
It speeds you up.

00:13:22.295 --> 00:13:24.025
If we run into a monster...

00:13:24.265 --> 00:13:26.825
...we use this to get away.

00:13:27.805 --> 00:13:28.705
I understand.

00:13:41.545 --> 00:13:42.745
It's a dog!

00:13:59.305 --> 00:14:00.665
So high.

00:14:11.545 --> 00:14:13.375
Hotaru.

00:14:47.215 --> 00:14:48.405
Shugo!

00:14:55.025 --> 00:14:55.685
Hotaru!

00:15:15.345 --> 00:15:16.575
Oh no!

00:15:18.845 --> 00:15:21.315
It's no good! Let's get out of here!

00:15:21.315 --> 00:15:21.875
No!

00:15:22.655 --> 00:15:24.445
If we leave now...

00:15:25.285 --> 00:15:27.115
...the Grunty will die.

00:15:29.455 --> 00:15:32.985
If it dies, that's just too sad.

00:15:33.865 --> 00:15:34.985
Hotaru!!

00:15:46.005 --> 00:15:47.235
Shugo!

00:15:47.845 --> 00:15:49.205
Are you all right?

00:15:49.445 --> 00:15:50.575
Damn!

00:15:58.015 --> 00:15:59.245
If I use this...

00:16:00.425 --> 00:16:03.015
No good! If it fails what will we do?

00:16:03.495 --> 00:16:05.485
I'm still only level 1!

00:16:21.345 --> 00:16:23.505
A grunty is going to die.

00:16:23.775 --> 00:16:25.215
Please let us pass!

00:16:25.545 --> 00:16:27.245
Stop, Hotaru!

00:16:27.515 --> 00:16:29.005
Please!

00:16:30.655 --> 00:16:31.845
No!

00:16:33.055 --> 00:16:35.385
Data Drain!

00:16:44.935 --> 00:16:45.665
I did it!

00:16:55.475 --> 00:16:56.175
Shugo.

00:17:03.915 --> 00:17:06.185
What are you doing playing around...

00:17:06.625 --> 00:17:07.085
...Kite?

00:17:07.885 --> 00:17:08.945
Eh?

00:17:09.295 --> 00:17:10.415
Sanjuro!

00:17:10.955 --> 00:17:13.755
Yo! I saw your email and raced here.

00:17:14.365 --> 00:17:15.765
But if Kite is here with you...

00:17:15.895 --> 00:17:18.595
...there should be no
reason to worry. Hmph.

00:17:19.035 --> 00:17:21.465
I'm not Kite.

00:17:22.005 --> 00:17:22.525
What?

00:17:23.035 --> 00:17:25.435
I'm Shugo.

00:17:26.805 --> 00:17:27.965
Shugo?

00:17:29.545 --> 00:17:30.345
I see...

00:17:30.415 --> 00:17:33.145
...you're the Character
Present Campaign winner.

00:17:33.815 --> 00:17:36.875
CC Corporation
certainly was generous.

00:17:51.865 --> 00:17:54.135
It's here. This is it!

00:17:55.535 --> 00:17:56.735
We did it!!

00:18:47.025 --> 00:18:48.545
It's such a playful child.

00:18:50.195 --> 00:18:52.155
It seems to like you, Hotaru.

00:18:52.595 --> 00:18:53.825
Is that true?

00:18:53.965 --> 00:18:55.585
I'm very happy.

00:18:56.065 --> 00:18:57.555
I'm glad for you, Hotaru.

00:18:57.595 --> 00:18:59.065
What? The...

00:19:00.035 --> 00:19:03.095
It's saved, I'm amazed.

00:19:03.435 --> 00:19:05.305
It looked like it'd caught something...

00:19:05.405 --> 00:19:06.735
...and I thought it would die.

00:19:09.075 --> 00:19:11.565
What do you mean?

00:19:13.615 --> 00:19:15.845
Ah! Thank you for taking care of it!

00:19:16.455 --> 00:19:17.615
Come here!

00:19:20.385 --> 00:19:22.825
It says it does not wish to go back!

00:19:23.355 --> 00:19:24.225
What?

00:19:25.565 --> 00:19:27.755
Doting on it only when it's healthy...

00:19:27.825 --> 00:19:29.795
...but throwing it away when
circumstances are bad.

00:19:30.735 --> 00:19:31.525
Do you think someone...

00:19:31.595 --> 00:19:33.825
...like that is qualified to
call themselves master?

00:19:34.135 --> 00:19:35.325
That's right!

00:19:36.375 --> 00:19:38.565
The responsibilities and
obligations of being...

00:19:38.775 --> 00:19:40.435
...a master in real
life is enough for me.

00:19:40.805 --> 00:19:42.795
Don't say such things on the net.

00:19:42.975 --> 00:19:44.305
It's just a Grunty.

00:19:44.745 --> 00:19:46.445
JUST a Grunty?

00:19:46.645 --> 00:19:47.235
Do you have any idea...

00:19:47.315 --> 00:19:49.615
...the lengths we went to, to save it?!

00:19:49.615 --> 00:19:50.745
Shugo.

00:19:50.855 --> 00:19:52.285
Stop it, Shugo.

00:19:53.785 --> 00:19:54.885
Hey brother!

00:19:55.025 --> 00:19:55.795
Rena?

00:19:55.795 --> 00:19:56.155
Eh?

00:19:56.955 --> 00:19:58.445
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:19:58.525 --> 00:19:59.395
Really.

00:20:00.925 --> 00:20:02.365
W... Who're you guys?

00:20:03.165 --> 00:20:03.825
We're...

00:20:04.465 --> 00:20:08.165
...the ones who were
called for "just a Grunty"!

00:20:08.435 --> 00:20:09.495
I'm disappointed...

00:20:10.075 --> 00:20:12.165
...that someone like you is its master.

00:20:13.245 --> 00:20:16.145
You're not worthy of
being called a gamer.

00:20:17.345 --> 00:20:19.435
W-Wait a sec!

00:20:19.685 --> 00:20:21.375
What are you going to do?

00:20:22.085 --> 00:20:26.675
Isn't this a game?
Let's all enjoy it... Right?

00:20:27.355 --> 00:20:28.845
Please excuse us a moment.

00:20:30.025 --> 00:20:33.985
Shutup and keep walking!

00:20:37.795 --> 00:20:39.695
I feel much better now.

00:20:40.835 --> 00:20:43.235
It feels so nice after
doing a good deed.

00:20:43.305 --> 00:20:43.705
Yep.

00:20:44.405 --> 00:20:46.565
What just happened?

00:20:47.005 --> 00:20:49.105
I think we're better off not knowing.

00:20:53.315 --> 00:20:55.445
Where is Sanjuro Sunarashi?

00:20:55.715 --> 00:20:56.045
Huh?

00:21:00.985 --> 00:21:03.425
It seems that you've found
employment at CC Corporation.

00:21:04.595 --> 00:21:07.785
I should congratulate you, Balmung.

00:21:08.795 --> 00:21:10.625
I wouldn't say it's something
to be happy about.

00:21:10.935 --> 00:21:14.125
Anyways. I have a favor to ask of you.

00:21:16.575 --> 00:21:20.535
Shugo, the character
that looks like Kite.

00:21:21.405 --> 00:21:23.005
I want you to train him.

00:21:25.115 --> 00:21:25.875
What for?

00:21:26.585 --> 00:21:28.575
I can't elaborate right now.

00:21:29.215 --> 00:21:34.085
Except to say that...

00:21:34.555 --> 00:21:35.955
..."Twilight" is drawing nearer.

00:21:48.405 --> 00:21:49.635
Understood!

00:21:49.905 --> 00:21:50.335
Preview

00:21:50.335 --> 00:21:52.275
Preview
I have event information!

00:21:52.275 --> 00:21:52.345
Preview

00:21:52.345 --> 00:21:55.405
Preview
The area "Distant Azure River" is
the Festival of the Weaver Maiden.

00:21:55.405 --> 00:21:55.645
Preview

00:21:55.645 --> 00:21:57.245
Preview
What should I wish for?

00:21:57.245 --> 00:21:57.575
What should I wish for?

00:21:57.845 --> 00:21:59.105
I'm the Weaver Maiden?

00:21:59.215 --> 00:22:01.805
Eh? I kiss my brother?!

00:22:01.945 --> 00:22:04.785
Tanabata Night

00:22:06.385 --> 00:22:16.825
Hashitteyuku kodomotachi
no hashagu warai koe ni
In the running children's
frolicking voices

00:22:17.195 --> 00:22:24.735
Hikari to kage oikakete mitaku naru
They want to chase
the light and shadows

00:22:28.005 --> 00:22:38.475
Midori no ha ni sukashite
mita ano taiyou no saki ni
Watching the sun shine
between the green leaves,

00:22:38.785 --> 00:22:47.555
Nani ga aru to omotteita no darou
wondering if something is there.

00:22:48.895 --> 00:22:59.105
Emerald Green hana wo
tsunda te no naka kara
From inside the picking hands,
the emerald green flowers

00:22:59.545 --> 00:23:10.045
Sora kaze tsuchi e to
sugata wo kaeteyuku
change their body to the
sky, the wind, the ground.

00:23:10.315 --> 00:23:22.255
Sono utsukushisa ni me wo hiraita
mabayushi sugiru basho de
Laying in that opulent place that
opened my eyes to its beauty,

00:23:22.565 --> 00:23:30.165
Nekoronda sora ni toikaketeru
Asking questions to the sky
